sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Login as Login view
    participant Auth as Authentication service
    participant Store as USERS table
    participant Factor as Session and 2FA simulation
    participant Audit as AUDIT_LOG
    participant Router as Role router

    User->>Login: Submit username and password
    Login->>Auth: authenticate(username, password)
    Auth->>Store: Load account, hash, salt, lock state
    Store-->>Auth: Account record or no result
    alt Unknown, inactive, or locked account
        Auth->>Audit: LOGIN_FAILED with safe context
        Auth-->>Login: Generic denial
    else Active account
        Auth->>Auth: Verify salted password hash
        alt Password mismatch
            Auth->>Store: Increment failed attempt count
            Auth->>Audit: LOGIN_FAILED and lockout transition
            Auth-->>Login: Generic denial
        else Password verified
            Auth->>Factor: Create session and optional 2FA challenge
            Factor-->>Auth: Session state and timeout
            Auth->>Audit: LOGIN_SUCCESS
            Auth->>Router: Resolve role, clearance, and linked record
            Router-->>Login: Least-privilege dashboard
            Login-->>User: Authorised workspace
        end
    end
    Note over Auth,Audit: Limits: public demo credentials, simulated 2FA, and a shared DB principal remain documented residual risks.
